sequenceDiagram
participant User as 用户
participant Frontend as 前端 (React)
participant API as 后端 API (Flask)
participant DB as 数据库 (SQLite)

User->>Frontend: 输入用户名/密码并点击登录
Frontend->>API: POST /api/auth/login
Note right of Frontend: { username, password }

API->>DB: 根据用户名查询用户

alt 用户不存在
    DB-->>API: Null
    API-->>Frontend: 401 Error (Invalid credentials)
else 用户存在
    DB-->>API: 返回 User 对象 (含 password_hash)
    API->>API: check_password_hash(hash, password)

    alt 密码匹配
        API->>API: jwt.encode(payload, secret)
        API-->>Frontend: 200 OK { token, user_id }
        Frontend->>Frontend: localStorage.setItem('user', data)
        Frontend-->>User: 跳转至仪表盘
    else 密码错误
        API-->>Frontend: 401 Error
        Frontend-->>User: 提示"用户名或密码错误"
    end
end
